<title>LATVIA: TABLE-Latvian GDP rises 2.6 pct yr/yr in Q1.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Latvian GDP rises 2.6 pct yr/yr in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Latvia's gross domestic product (GDP) rose 2.6 percent in comparative prices in the first quarter of 1997 from the first three months of 1996, the statistics committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p> LATVIAN GDP		 Q1 1997     Q4 1996    Q1 1996</p>
<p> GDP change yr/yr (pct)  2.6	   3.2	  2.7</p>
<p> GDP (millions of lats)  696	   762	  610</p>
<p>NOTE - The percent changes are calculated under constant 1995 changes while the total GDP in millions of lats is in current prices, which do not strip out inflation.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
